      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nEk Shopping List Manager banayein jo multi-line input read kare jab tak 'show' command na mile:\n- 'add <item>': list me item append kare\n- 'remove <item>': agar item present hai to remove kare\n- 'show': final list print kare\n\n### Instructions\n- Empty list `cart = []` banayein.\n- Loop me lines read karein.\n- Commands execute karke final list print karein.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. `cart = []`\n2. Command parse karein (`add`, `remove`, `show`).\n3. 'show' milne par `print(cart)`.",
