      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nPehli line me number of students `n` input lijiye. Agli `n` lines par student name aur unke marks space-separated input lijiye.\nPass mark 40 hai. Students ko marks ke descending order me sort karein.\nHar student ke liye print karein: `{Rank}. {Name} - {Marks} ({Status})` jahan status 'Pass' ya 'Fail' ho.\nAakhri line par Class Average (`Average: {avg:.2f}`) print karein.\n\n### Instructions\n- Read records: `for _ in range(n): name, m = input().split(); records.append((name, int(m)))`\n- Sort descending: `records.sort(key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)`\n- Loop: determine Pass/Fail and print with rank.\n- Print Class Average.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Parse `n` and each student's name and marks.\n2. Sort by marks descending.\n3. Print rank, name, marks, Pass/Fail status.\n4. Print class average.",
