      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nEmpty dictionary `db = {}` se shuru karein. Multi-line input read karein jab tak 'show' command na mile:\n- `add <key> <val>`: key-value pair store kare\n- `remove <key>`: agar key present hai to remove kare\n- `show`: final dictionary print kare\n\n### Instructions\n- While loop me commands execute karein aur show par break karein.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Commands loop: `add`, `remove`, `show`.\n2. Print resulting dictionary on `show`.",
      referenceCode: "db = {}\nwhile True:\n    try:\n        line = input().strip()\n        if not line:\n            continue\n        if line == 'show':\n            print(db)\n            break\n        elif line.startswith('add '):\n            _, k, v = line.split()\n            db[k] = v\n        elif line.startswith('remove '):\n            _, k = line.split()\n            if k in db:\n                del db[k]\n    except EOFError:\n        print(db)\n        break",
      starterCode: "# Dictionary Management Challenge\n",
      sampleInput: "add a 10\nadd b 20\nremove a\nshow",
