      question: "Student Marks Management",
      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nStudent marks dictionary manager banayein. Multi-line input padhein jab tak 'exit' na mile:\n- `add <name> <mark>`: store name and integer marks\n- `search <name>`: student ke marks print kare ya 'Not Found'\n- `exit`: terminate\n\n### Instructions\n- Dictionary `db = {}` me operations handle karein.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Process `add`, `search`, `exit` commands.\n2. Output marks or 'Not Found'.",
