      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nUser se do lines par student IDs input lein (Course 1 aur Course 2).\nSet operations ka use karke 4 lines par sorted lists print karein:\n1. Students in both courses (`A & B`)\n2. Students in either course (`A | B`)\n3. Students only in Course 1 (`A - B`)\n4. Students only in Course 2 (`B - A`)\n\n### Instructions\n- 4 lines par sorted lists print karein.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Parse `A` and `B` as sets.\n2. Print `sorted(A & B)`, `sorted(A | B)`, `sorted(A - B)`, `sorted(B - A)`.",
      referenceCode: "A = set(input().split())\nB = set(input().split())\nprint(sorted(A & B))\nprint(sorted(A | B))\nprint(sorted(A - B))\nprint(sorted(B - A))",
