      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nPehli line me number of records `n` input lijiye.\nAgli `n` lines par `ID Name Marks` input lein (e.g. `101 Amit 85`).\nRules:\n1. Agar ID pehle se registered hai to duplicate record ko skip karein.\n2. Pass mark 40 hai.\n3. Sabhi unique students ko unki ID ke sorted order me print karein: `ID: {id} | Name: {name} | Marks: {marks} | Status: {Pass/Fail}`\n4. Aakhri line par Class Average print karein: `Class Average: {avg:.2f}` (records empty hone par 0.00).\n\n### Instructions\n- Set se ID uniqueness track karein, records store karein, sorted print karein with average.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Parse `n` records skipping duplicate IDs.\n2. Sort students by ID.\n3. Print each formatted student and Class Average.",
