      "question": "Problem Decomposition Challenge",
      "hindiDescription": "### Problem Statement\nDecompose challenge: Given string `text = 'python123'`, count karein letters aur digits alag-alag.\n\n### Instructions\n- `letters` aur `digits` count calculate karein.\n- Format: 'Letters: X, Digits: Y' print karein.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. `isalpha()` aur `isdigit()` check karein loop me.\n2. Counters increment karein.\n3. Output print karein.",
      "referenceCode": "text = 'python123'\nletters = sum(1 for c in text if c.isalpha())\ndigits = sum(1 for c in text if c.isdigit())\nprint(f'Letters: {letters}, Digits: {digits}')",
