      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nString palindrome check karne ke liye recursive function `is_palindrome(s)` banayein (spaces remove karein aur lowercase normalize karein: `s = s.lower().replace(' ', '')`).\nRecursive helper first aur last character compare kare. `True` ya `False` return karke print karein.\n\n### Instructions\n- Normalization and recursive palindrome check.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Normalize case and spaces.\n2. Recursive check: `if txt[0] != txt[-1]: return False`\n3. Print result.",
