      hindiDescription: "### Problem Statement\nAlag-alag functions banayein: `add(a, b)`, `sub(a, b)`, `mul(a, b)`, `div(a, b)`. `div()` me division by zero hone par 'Error' return karein, warna 2 decimals me format karein.\nUser se operator aur do numbers space-separated input lekar appropriate function call karein aur 2 decimal places me result print karein.\n\n### Instructions\n- Modular function design for four arithmetic operations.\n\n### Progressive Hints\n1. Define add, sub, mul, div functions.\n2. Parse operator and operands.\n3. Call matching function and print.",
      referenceCode: "def add(a, b): return a + b\ndef sub(a, b): return a - b\ndef mul(a, b): return a * b\ndef div(a, b): return 'Error' if b == 0 else f'{a / b:.2f}'\n\nop, a_str, b_str = input().split()\na, b = float(a_str), float(b_str)\nif op == '+': print(f'{add(a, b):.2f}')\nelif op == '-': print(f'{sub(a, b):.2f}')\nelif op == '*': print(f'{mul(a, b):.2f}')\nelif op == '/': print(div(a, b))",
